{"sha": "71d1415b9dcf98b8311a67fe385799bac91123dddc22655706f594d73f022352", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:complex} 章 --- 复数}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:complex:1}", "$1 + \\iu = \\sqrt 2\\, \\eu^{\\iu\\pi/4}$；", "$\\;\\sqrt 3 - \\iu = 2\\, \\eu^{-\\iu\\pi/6}$；", "$\\;-5 = 5\\, \\eu^{\\iu\\pi}$；", "\\[", "\\frac{1 + \\iu}{\\sqrt 3 - \\iu}", "= \\frac{\\sqrt 2}{2}\\, \\eu^{\\iu(\\pi/4 + \\pi/6)}", "= \\frac{\\sqrt 2}{2}\\, \\eu^{5\\iu\\pi/12}.", "\\]", "代数地计算同一商（分子分母同乘分母的共轭复数）：", "\\[", "\\frac{(1 + \\iu)(\\sqrt 3 + \\iu)}{4}", "= \\frac{(\\sqrt 3 - 1) + \\iu(\\sqrt 3 + 1)}{4}.", "\\]", "将其与 $\\frac{\\sqrt 2}{2}(\\cos\\frac{5\\pi}{12} +", "\\iu\\sin\\frac{5\\pi}{12})$ 的三角形式比较，得：", "\\[", "\\cos\\frac{5\\pi}{12} = \\frac{\\sqrt 6 - \\sqrt 2}{4},", "\\qquad", "\\sin\\frac{5\\pi}{12} = \\frac{\\sqrt 6 + \\sqrt 2}{4}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:complex:2}", "$(1+\\iu)^2 = 2\\iu$，故 $(1+\\iu)^{20} = (2\\iu)^{10} = 2^{10}\\,\\iu^{10}", "= 1024 \\times (-1) = -1024$。", "", "由指数形式 $(1+\\iu)^n = 2^{n/2}\\, \\eu^{\\iu n\\pi/4}$，", "它为实数当且仅当 $\\sin\\frac{n\\pi}{4} = 0$，即 $4 \\mid n$。故 $(1+\\iu)^n", "\\in \\R$ 恰对 $4$ 的倍数成立（此时取值 $(-4)^{n/4}$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:complex:3}", "$\\abs{z - 2} = \\abs{z + \\iu}$：到点 $2$ 与", "$-\\iu$ 等距的点 --- 即连接 $(2, 0)$", "与 $(0, -1)$ 的线段的垂直平分线。", "", "$\\abs{z - 1} = 2$：圆心为 $1$、半径为 $2$ 的圆。", "", "$\\frac{z-1}{z+1} \\in \\iu\\R$：由", "\\cref{prop:b1:complex:geometry}~(3)，点 $M(z)$、$A(1)$", "、$B(-1)$ 满足：直线 $MA$ 与 $MB$ 垂直（或 $z = 1$，此时", "商为 $0 \\in \\iu\\R$）。所求集合是", "以 $[-1, 1]$ 为直径的圆（即单位圆），去掉点 $-1$，该点处的商", "无定义。\\emph{用计算验证：}$z = \\eu^{\\iu\\theta}$ 得", "$\\frac{z-1}{z+1} = \\frac{\\eu^{\\iu\\theta/2}(\\eu^{\\iu\\theta/2} -", "\\eu^{-\\iu\\theta/2})}{\\eu^{\\iu\\theta/2}(\\eu^{\\iu\\theta/2} +", "\\eu^{-\\iu\\theta/2})} = \\iu\\tan\\frac\\theta2 \\in \\iu\\R$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:complex:4}", "线性化：", "\\[", "\\sin^4\\theta", "= \\Bigl(\\frac{\\eu^{\\iu\\theta} - \\eu^{-\\iu\\theta}}{2\\iu}\\Bigr)^{\\!4}", "= \\frac{\\eu^{4\\iu\\theta} - 4\\eu^{2\\iu\\theta} + 6 - 4\\eu^{-2\\iu\\theta}", "+ \\eu^{-4\\iu\\theta}}{16}", "= \\frac{\\cos 4\\theta - 4\\cos 2\\theta + 3}{8}.", "\\]", "展开：由棣莫弗公式，$\\cos 4\\theta = \\Re\\bigl((c +", "\\iu s)^4\\bigr) = c^4 - 6c^2 s^2 + s^4$，其中 $c = \\cos\\theta$，$s =", "\\sin\\theta$；代入 $s^2 = 1 - c^2$，得：", "\\[", "\\cos 4\\theta = c^4 - 6c^2(1 - c^2) + (1 - c^2)^2", "= 8c^4 - 8c^2 + 1 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:complex:5}", "$8\\iu = 8\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\pi/2}$，故立方根为 $2\\,\\eu^{\\iu(\\pi/6 +", "2k\\pi/3)}$，$k = 0, 1, 2$：", "\\[", "z_0 = 2\\eu^{\\iu\\pi/6} = \\sqrt 3 + \\iu,\\quad", "z_1 = 2\\eu^{5\\iu\\pi/6} = -\\sqrt 3 + \\iu,\\quad", "z_2 = 2\\eu^{3\\iu\\pi/2} = -2\\iu :", "\\]", "这三点构成半径为 $2$ 的圆上的正三角形。", "", "$-4 = 4\\eu^{\\iu\\pi}$，故 $z^4 = -4$ 的解为 $\\sqrt 2\\,", "\\eu^{\\iu(\\pi/4 + k\\pi/2)}$：$\\;1 + \\iu$、$-1 + \\iu$、$-1 - \\iu$、", "$1 - \\iu$。将共轭根两两配对：", "\\[", "X^4 + 4 = \\bigl(X^2 - 2X + 2\\bigr)\\bigl(X^2 + 2X + 2\\bigr),", "\\]", "由于 $(X - (1+\\iu))(X - (1-\\iu)) = X^2 - 2X + 2$，另一组", "类似。（展开即可验证。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:complex:6}", "$C_n + \\iu S_n = \\sum_{k=0}^{n} \\eu^{\\iu k\\theta} =", "\\frac{\\eu^{\\iu(n+1)\\theta} - 1}{\\eu^{\\iu\\theta} - 1}$（等比求和，", "公比 $\\eu^{\\iu\\theta} \\neq 1$）。半角因式分解", "（见\\cref{met:b1:complex:trig}~(4)），作用于分子与分母：", "\\[", "\\frac{2\\iu\\sin\\frac{(n+1)\\theta}{2}\\, \\eu^{\\iu(n+1)\\theta/2}}", "{2\\iu\\sin\\frac{\\theta}{2}\\, \\eu^{\\iu\\theta/2}}", "= \\frac{\\sin\\frac{(n+1)\\theta}{2}}{\\sin\\frac{\\theta}{2}}\\,", "\\eu^{\\iu n\\theta/2}.", "\\]", "分别取实部与虚部：", "\\[", "C_n = \\frac{\\sin\\frac{(n+1)\\theta}{2}}{\\sin\\frac{\\theta}{2}}", "\\cos\\frac{n\\theta}{2},", "\\qquad", "S_n = \\frac{\\sin\\frac{(n+1)\\theta}{2}}{\\sin\\frac{\\theta}{2}}", "\\sin\\frac{n\\theta}{2}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", ""]}